00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.160
Some of the highlights that I want to hit on this budget

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.400
are under admin services.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.600
You'll see materials.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:17.360
